@startuml Kafka Components Detail
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Kafka 核心组件详细交互图

package "Network Layer" {
    component [Acceptor Thread] as ACC
    component [Processor Thread 1] as PROC1
    component [Processor Thread 2] as PROC2
    component [Processor Thread N] as PROCN
    queue [Request Queue] as RQ
    queue [Response Queue] as RSQ
}

package "Request Processing" {
    component [Handler Thread 1] as HAND1
    component [Handler Thread 2] as HAND2
    component [Handler Thread M] as HANDM
    component [KafkaApis] as APIS
}

package "Storage Layer" {
    component [ReplicaManager] as RM
    component [LogManager] as LM
    component [Log] as LOG
    component [LogSegment] as LS
    file [Data File (.log)] as DF
    file [Index File (.index)] as IF
    file [Time Index (.timeindex)] as TIF
}

package "Coordination" {
    component [GroupCoordinator] as GC
    component [TransactionCoordinator] as TC
    component [MetadataCache] as MC
}

package "KRaft (New Architecture)" {
    component [KafkaRaftClient] as KRC
    component [RaftManager] as RAFTM
    component [QuorumController] as QC
}

' Network flow
ACC --> PROC1 : New Connection
ACC --> PROC2 : New Connection
ACC --> PROCN : New Connection

PROC1 --> RQ : Request
PROC2 --> RQ : Request
PROCN --> RQ : Request

RQ --> HAND1 : Dequeue
RQ --> HAND2 : Dequeue
RQ --> HANDM : Dequeue

HAND1 --> APIS : Process
HAND2 --> APIS : Process
HANDM --> APIS : Process

APIS --> RSQ : Response
RSQ --> PROC1 : Response
RSQ --> PROC2 : Response
RSQ --> PROCN : Response

' API processing
APIS --> RM : Produce/Fetch
APIS --> GC : Group Operations
APIS --> TC : Transaction Operations
APIS --> MC : Metadata Queries

' Storage operations
RM --> LM : Log Operations
LM --> LOG : Manage Logs
LOG --> LS : Active Segment
LS --> DF : Write Data
LS --> IF : Update Index
LS --> TIF : Update Time Index

' KRaft operations
APIS --> RAFTM : Metadata Changes
RAFTM --> KRC : Raft Operations
KRC --> QC : Controller Operations
QC --> MC : Update Metadata

note right of ACC
  单线程处理新连接
  为每个连接分配Processor
end note

note right of PROC1
  多线程处理I/O
  每个线程有自己的Selector
  读取请求，写入响应
end note

note right of HAND1
  多线程处理业务逻辑
  调用KafkaApis处理请求
  生成响应
end note

note bottom of LS
  日志段包含：
  - 数据文件：实际消息
  - 索引文件：偏移量索引
  - 时间索引：时间戳索引
end note

note right of KRC
  KRaft替代Zookeeper
  - 内置共识协议
  - 简化架构
  - 更好的可扩展性
end note

@enduml
